WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Personal Finance Tracker. Fictional account and synthetic data.
Live market quotes and Gemini are disabled. Silent walkthrough.

00:03.000 --> 00:12.900
Dashboard: income, expenses, balance, charts and recent activity
calculated from the fictional Alex Morgan account.

00:14.600 --> 00:18.700
Transactions: enter a $24.50 Dining expense at Demo Corner Cafe,
described as “Synthetic walkthrough lunch,” then save it.

00:18.800 --> 00:26.800
The real application saves the expense and updates its records.
No successful response or interface state has been simulated.

00:28.600 --> 00:36.800
Analytics: category spending, income versus expenses and
six-month trends derived from synthetic transactions.

00:38.600 --> 00:46.800
Budgets: category spending and remaining amounts.
Dining now includes the $24.50 expense saved in this walkthrough.

00:50.100 --> 00:56.900
Recurring: monthly schedules and December 5 next occurrence dates.
Creating a schedule immediately records its first occurrence.

00:57.000 --> 01:07.000
Investments: fictional DEMO and SAMPLE holdings and recorded costs.
Live quotes, market values and returns are unavailable.
